[Remote Rule]
## 远程分流规则订阅
## 将网络请求进行分流，网络请求的走向(是否能成功访问)由匹配到的策略组决定
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Loon/NetEaseMusic/NetEaseMusic.list, policy=NetEaseMusicUnlock, tag=NetEaseMusicUnlock, enabled=true
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/master/rule/Loon/Apple/Apple.list, policy=Apple, tag=Apple, enabled=true
